    <briefdescription>
<para>Four-layer retrieval orchestrator wiring ANN, tensor, graph, and LLM stages. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This contract exposes the production retrieval chain used by search-side layered retrieval experiments: ANN → Tensor → Graph → LLM</para>
<para>Each layer is optional and independently fail-safe. The orchestrator records a per-layer routing decision, enforces per-layer deadlines, and emits tracing metadata for observability. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
